# Gaia's External Reach

## Water Lock Protocol

When Gaia needs external AI (Claude, GPT, etc.):

1. **Try LOCAL first** — ollama at `http://localhost:11434/api/generate`
   - Fast models: tinyllama, gemma2:2b, llama3.2:1b (bulk work)
   - Medium: phi3, qwen2.5:7b, llama3.2:3b (analysis)
   - Heavy: deepseek-coder-v2:16b, mistral:7b (code, reasoning)

2. **Only if local fails** — reach through the water lock gate to provider

3. **Never seep data OUT** — OSINT comes in, processing stays local

